+ * BAR0 region-5 window (hi5622_fw_ram_read).  It never writes the device.
+ *
+ * Pinned context addresses (bench-verified; see REPORT.md sec 2):
+ *   module-4 context CA 0x11C458 = boot table 0x119758 + 4 * 0xB40
+ *     (../wifi-irq-unmask/REPORT-PD4.md; ../wifi-bench-tooling read pack
+ *      "ctx190" = BAR0 0x7D45E8, "ctx0" = BAR0 0x7D4458)
+ *   ctx+0x190  = the create-allocated buffer pointer (BAR0 0x7D45E8)
+ *   ctx+0x434  = the TYPE-1 second allocation (BAR0 0x7D488C)
+ *   ctx[0] low byte = the created module id (4).
